# AI tooling — local by default; opt in `.claude/skills/` and
# `.claude/agent-verdicts/` so checked-in skills can ship with their
# design-rationale companion docs. Everything else under `.claude/`
# (settings, worktrees, transcripts) stays local.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agent-verdicts/
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/
.windsurf/
